---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="포트폴리오 | MK Stock Lab" activePath="/portfolio">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div>
      <div class="portfolio-title-row">
        <p class="eyebrow">포트폴리오</p>
        <div class="portfolio-h1-row">
          <h1>내 투자 포트폴리오</h1>
          <button class="icon-button refresh-icon-button portfolio-refresh-btn" id="portfolio-refresh" type="button"
                  aria-label="현재 포트폴리오 다시 계산" title="현재 포트폴리오 다시 계산">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20 11a8 8 0 1 0-2.34 5.66"></path>
              <path d="M20 5v6h-6"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="lead">국내와 미국 주식, ETF 보유 종목을 관리합니다. 국내 종목은 실시간 시세로 평가금액과 손익을 계산합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="portfolio-loading-state" id="portfolio-readiness" data-state="checking" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
    <p class="portfolio-loading-copy" id="portfolio-readiness-copy">포트폴리오 데이터를 불러오는 중입니다.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="portfolio-lock-state hidden" id="portfolio-lock-state" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="lock-visual" aria-hidden="true">🔐</div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">접속 필요</p>
      <h2>로그인이 필요합니다</h2>
      <p>회원가입 또는 로그인 후 포트폴리오와 보유 종목을 관리할 수 있습니다.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="primary-action" id="portfolio-login-action" type="button">회원가입 / 로그인</button>
  </section>

  <section class="portfolio-mvp hidden" id="portfolio-mvp">

    <div class="portfolio-selector-bar portfolio-bookmark-tabs">
      <div class="portfolio-tab-list" id="portfolio-list" aria-live="polite" role="tablist" aria-label="포트폴리오 선택"></div>
      <div class="empty-state hidden" id="portfolio-empty">아직 등록된 포트폴리오가 없습니다.</div>
    </div>

    <section class="portfolio-detail portfolio-dashboard panel" id="portfolio-detail-panel" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="portfolio-panel-header">
        <div class="portfolio-panel-info">
          <h2 id="selected-portfolio-title">포트폴리오를 선택하세요</h2>
          <p id="selected-portfolio-meta">포트폴리오를 선택하면 보유 종목 관리 영역이 표시됩니다.</p>
          <p class="valuation-status-copy" id="valuation-status-copy" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden></p>
          <div class="portfolio-kpi-summary hidden" id="portfolio-kpi-summary">
            <p class="kpi-label">총 자산</p>
            <p class="kpi-value">···</p>
            <p class="kpi-profit neutral">···</p>
            <p class="kpi-note">KRW 기준 합산 · USD 환산 현재 미지원</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portfolio-panel-actions">
          <button class="primary-action hidden" id="open-position-sheet" type="button">종목 추가</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="portfolio-list-controls-bar">
        <div class="segmented-control" id="currency-display-toggle" aria-label="통화 표시 기준">
          <button class="active" type="button" data-display-mode="local" aria-label="각 종목의 현지 통화 기준" title="각 종목의 현지 통화 기준">현지</button>
          <button type="button" data-display-mode="krw" aria-label="원화 기준" title="원화 기준">₩</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="empty-state" id="positions-empty">포트폴리오를 선택하면 보유 종목을 관리할 수 있습니다.</div>
      <div
        class="positions-list-wrap hidden"
        id="positions-list-wrap"
        role="region"
        aria-label="보유 종목 목록, 좌우로 스크롤 가능"
        tabindex="0"
      >
        <div class="positions-category-header" id="positions-category-header">
          <div class="positions-category-grid">
            <div class="positions-category-cell positions-category-cell--avatar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="positions-category-cell">종목</div>
            <div class="positions-category-cell positions-category-cell--sortable" data-sort-column="weight" aria-label="비중 기준 정렬">
              <span>비중</span>
              <span class="sort-arrow-stack">
                <button class="sort-arrow-button" type="button" data-sort="weight-desc" aria-label="비중 높은 순 정렬">▲</button>
                <button class="sort-arrow-button" type="button" data-sort="weight-asc" aria-label="비중 낮은 순 정렬">▼</button>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="positions-category-cell">수량</div>
            <div class="positions-category-cell positions-category-cell--group">
              <span class="col-group-top">평단가</span>
              <span class="col-group-bottom">현재가</span>
            </div>
            <div class="positions-category-cell positions-category-cell--group" data-sort-column="valuation" aria-label="금액 기준 정렬">
              <span class="col-group-top-sortable">
                <span>평가금</span>
                <span class="sort-arrow-stack">
                  <button class="sort-arrow-button" type="button" data-sort="valuation-desc" aria-label="평가금 높은 순 정렬">▲</button>
                  <button class="sort-arrow-button" type="button" data-sort="valuation-asc" aria-label="평가금 낮은 순 정렬">▼</button>
                </span>
              </span>
              <span class="col-group-bottom">원금</span>
            </div>
            <div class="positions-category-cell positions-category-cell--group" data-sort-column="return" aria-label="수익 기준 정렬">
              <span class="col-group-top-sortable">
                <span>수익률</span>
                <span class="sort-arrow-stack">
                  <button class="sort-arrow-button" type="button" data-sort="return-desc" aria-label="수익률 높은 순 정렬">▲</button>
                  <button class="sort-arrow-button" type="button" data-sort="return-asc" aria-label="수익률 낮은 순 정렬">▼</button>
                </span>
              </span>
              <span class="col-group-bottom-sortable">
                <span>수익금</span>
                <span class="sort-arrow-stack">
                  <button class="sort-arrow-button" type="button" data-sort="profit-desc" aria-label="수익금 높은 순 정렬">▲</button>
                  <button class="sort-arrow-button" type="button" data-sort="profit-asc" aria-label="수익금 낮은 순 정렬">▼</button>
                </span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="positions-category-cell positions-category-cell--group">
              <span class="col-group-top">배당률</span>
              <span class="col-group-bottom">배당주기</span>
            </div>
            <div class="positions-category-cell" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="positions-list" id="positions-list"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </section>

  <div class="portfolio-sheet" id="portfolio-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="portfolio-sheet-title">
    <button class="portfolio-sheet-backdrop" id="portfolio-sheet-backdrop" type="button" aria-label="포트폴리오 입력창 닫기"></button>
    <section class="portfolio-sheet-panel">
      <header class="portfolio-sheet-header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">포트폴리오</p>
          <h2 id="portfolio-sheet-title">포트폴리오 만들기</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="table-action-button" id="portfolio-sheet-close" type="button">닫기</button>
      </header>
      <form class="compact-form" id="portfolio-form">
        <input type="hidden" id="portfolio-id" />
        <label>
          이름
          <input id="portfolio-name" name="name" type="text" maxlength="120" required placeholder="계좌 이름" />
        </label>
        <label>
          기준 통화
          <select id="portfolio-base-currency" name="baseCurrency" aria-describedby="portfolio-base-currency-hint">
            <option value="KRW">KRW</option>
            <option value="USD">USD</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <p class="field-hint" id="portfolio-base-currency-hint">
          현재 합산 평가금액은 원화(KRW) 기준으로 제공되며, USD 환산은 지원하지 않습니다.
        </p>
        <div class="form-actions">
          <button class="primary-action" id="portfolio-submit" type="submit">포트폴리오 만들기</button>
          <button class="text-button hidden" id="portfolio-cancel-edit" type="button">수정 취소</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="position-sheet" id="position-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="position-sheet-title">
    <button class="position-sheet-backdrop" id="position-sheet-backdrop" type="button" aria-label="입력창 닫기"></button>
    <section class="position-sheet-panel">
      <header class="position-sheet-header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">보유 종목</p>
          <h2 id="position-sheet-title">종목 추가</h2>
        </div>
        <button class="table-action-button" id="position-sheet-close" type="button">닫기</button>
      </header>
      <form class="position-form" id="position-form">
        <input type="hidden" id="position-id" />
        <input type="hidden" id="position-symbol" />
        <input type="hidden" id="position-market" value="KR" />
        <div class="form-grid">
          <label class="form-field-wide position-combobox-field">
            종목명 또는 티커
            <div class="position-combobox-wrap">
              <input
                id="position-security-input"
                type="text"
                maxlength="160"
                required
                autocomplete="off"
                spellcheck="false"
                placeholder="삼성전자 또는 005930"
                role="combobox"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-haspopup="listbox"
                aria-autocomplete="list"
                aria-controls="position-search-results"
              />
              <div class="position-search-dropdown hidden" id="position-search-dropdown">
                <div
                  class="position-search-results"
                  id="position-search-results"
                  role="listbox"
                  aria-label="종목 검색 결과"
                ></div>
                <p class="position-search-empty hidden" id="position-search-empty" aria-live="polite">
                  검색 결과가 없습니다. 종목명이나 종목코드를 다시 확인해 주세요.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </label>
          <label>
            자산 유형
            <select id="position-asset-type" disabled aria-readonly="true">
              <option value="stock">주식</option>
              <option value="etf">ETF</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>
            통화
            <select id="position-currency" disabled aria-readonly="true">
              <option value="KRW">KRW</option>
              <option value="USD">USD</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>
            매수일
            <input id="position-buy-date" type="date" />
          </label>
          <label>
            매수가
            <input id="position-buy-price" type="number" min="0" step="0.0001" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            수량
            <input id="position-quantity" type="number" min="0.0001" step="0.0001" required />
          </label>
        </div>
        <label>
          메모
          <textarea id="position-memo" maxlength="500" rows="3" placeholder="선택 입력"></textarea>
        </label>
        <div class="form-actions">
          <button class="primary-action" id="position-submit" type="submit">종목 추가</button>
          <button class="text-button" id="position-cancel-edit" type="button">취소</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="toast hidden" id="portfolio-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <script>
    import securityLogoMap from '../data/securityLogos.json';
    import { bootstrapProfileForCurrentSession } from '../lib/profileBootstrap';
    import {
      portfolioApi,
      PortfolioApiError,
      type Portfolio,
      type PortfolioPosition,
      type PortfolioValuationRow,
      type PortfolioValuationTotals,
      type PortfolioValuationResult,
    } from '../lib/portfolioClient';
    import { getBrowserSupabaseClient, isSupabaseConfigured } from '../lib/supabase';
    import { userRetentionApi, hasRetentionSession } from '../lib/userRetentionClient';
    import { computeDialogFocusWrap, computeTabRovingNavigation } from '../lib/portfolio/portfolioKeyboardNav';
    import { resolvePositionSubmitIdentity } from '../lib/portfolio/portfolioPositionIdentity';
    import {
      decideBootstrapAction,
      decidePositionsFetch,
      decideValuationFetch,
    } from '../lib/portfolio/portfolioLoadLifecycle';
    import { fetchChartAiJson } from '../lib/chart-ai/chart-ai-authenticated-fetch';

    type PortfolioState =
      | 'checking'
      | 'public_config_missing'
      | 'signed_out'
      | 'signed_in'
      | 'profile_pending'
      | 'profile_ready'
      | 'profile_failed'
      | 'profile_config_missing'
      | 'api_pending'
      | 'portfolio_config_missing'
      | 'ready';
    type DisplayPortfolioPosition = PortfolioPosition & {
      sourcePortfolioIds?: string[];
      sourcePortfolioNames?: string[];
      sourcePositionIds?: string[];
    };
    type ValuationState = 'idle' | 'loading' | 'full' | 'partial' | 'unavailable' | 'empty' | 'error';
    type ValuationStaleState = 'fresh' | 'stale-but-usable' | 'unavailable';
    type AppState = {
      portfolios: Portfolio[];
      positions: DisplayPortfolioPosition[];
      positionsByPortfolioId: Record<string, DisplayPortfolioPosition[]>;
      selectedPortfolioId: string | null;
      portfolioOrder: string[];
      positionSort: 'none' | 'weight-asc' | 'weight-desc' | 'valuation-asc' | 'valuation-desc' | 'return-asc' | 'return-desc' | 'profit-asc' | 'profit-desc';
      currencyDisplayMode: 'local' | 'krw';
      loading: boolean;
      positionValuations: Record<string, PortfolioValuationRow>;
      valuationState: ValuationState;
      valuationMessage: string | null;
      valuationTotals: PortfolioValuationTotals | null;
      valuationGeneratedAt: string | null;
      valuationStaleState: ValuationStaleState | null;
      // Phase 4F (F-MED-01): true only while a valuation refetch runs IN THE BACKGROUND (a prior
      // usable result is already on screen) -- drives a subtle status line instead of the full
      // "평가하는 중" loading takeover. See loadValuation.
      valuationRefreshing: boolean;
    };

    const state: AppState = {
      portfolios: [],
      positions: [],
      positionsByPortfolioId: {},
      selectedPortfolioId: null,
      portfolioOrder: [],
      positionSort: 'none',
      currencyDisplayMode: 'local',
      loading: false,
      positionValuations: {},
      valuationState: 'idle',
      valuationMessage: null,
      valuationTotals: null,
      valuationGeneratedAt: null,
      valuationStaleState: null,
      valuationRefreshing: false,
    };

    const stateContent: Record<PortfolioState, { title: string; copy: string; login: string; profile: string; api: string; showLogin: boolean; showApp: boolean }> = {
      checking: {
        title: '로그인 상태 대기',
        copy: '로그인과 프로필 준비가 완료되면 포트폴리오 데이터를 불러옵니다.',
        login: '대기 중',
        profile: '대기 중',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      public_config_missing: {
        title: '로그인 설정 필요',
        copy: '로그인 설정이 아직 완료되지 않아 포트폴리오를 사용할 수 없습니다.',
        login: '설정 필요',
        profile: '대기 중',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      signed_out: {
        title: '로그인이 필요합니다',
        copy: '로그인하면 프로필을 준비하고 포트폴리오를 불러옵니다.',
        login: '필요',
        profile: '대기 중',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: true,
        showApp: false,
      },
      signed_in: {
        title: '로그인 확인 완료',
        copy: '프로필 상태를 확인하고 있습니다.',
        login: '로그인됨',
        profile: '대기 중',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      profile_pending: {
        title: '프로필 준비 중',
        copy: '프로필 준비가 끝나면 포트폴리오 데이터를 불러옵니다.',
        login: '로그인됨',
        profile: '준비 중',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      api_pending: {
        title: '포트폴리오 API 대기',
        copy: '프로필 준비가 완료되어 포트폴리오 데이터를 불러오고 있습니다.',
        login: '로그인됨',
        profile: '준비 완료',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      profile_ready: {
        title: '프로필 준비 완료',
        copy: '포트폴리오 API 상태를 확인하고 있습니다.',
        login: '로그인됨',
        profile: '준비 완료',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      profile_failed: {
        title: '프로필 설정 확인 필요',
        copy: '프로필 설정이 완료되지 않아 포트폴리오 데이터를 불러오지 않았습니다.',
        login: '로그인됨',
        profile: '확인 필요',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      profile_config_missing: {
        title: '프로필 API 설정 필요',
        copy: '프로필 API 설정이 아직 완료되지 않아 포트폴리오를 사용할 수 없습니다.',
        login: '로그인됨',
        profile: '설정 필요',
        api: '대기 중',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      portfolio_config_missing: {
        title: '포트폴리오 API 설정 필요',
        copy: '포트폴리오 API 설정이 아직 완료되지 않았습니다.',
        login: '로그인됨',
        profile: '준비 완료',
        api: '설정 필요',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: false,
      },
      ready: {
        title: '포트폴리오 준비 완료',
        copy: '실시간 국내 시세로 포트폴리오를 평가합니다. 해외 종목 실시간 평가는 다음 단계에서 지원됩니다.',
        login: '로그인됨',
        profile: '준비 완료',
        api: '사용 가능',
        showLogin: false,
        showApp: true,
      },
    };

    const money = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 4 });
    const usdMoney = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US', { style: 'currency', currency: 'USD', maximumFractionDigits: 4 });
    const krwMoney = new Intl.NumberFormat('ko-KR', { maximumFractionDigits: 0 });
    const logoMappings = securityLogoMap as Record<string, { name?: string; symbol?: string; country?: 'KR' | 'US'; logoUrl?: string }>;
    const positionSheetMotionMs = 260;
    const aggregatePortfolioId = '__all_portfolios__';
    let positionSheetCloseTimer: number | null = null;
    let portfolioSheetOpener: HTMLElement | null = null;
    let positionSheetOpener: HTMLElement | null = null;

    const getDialogFocusableElements = (panel: HTMLElement | null): HTMLElement[] => {
      if (!panel) return [];
      return Array.from(
        panel.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('button, [href], input, select, textarea, [tabindex]:not([tabindex="-1"])'),
      ).filter((node) => !node.hasAttribute('disabled') && node.offsetParent !== null);
    };

    const restoreOpenerFocus = (opener: HTMLElement | null) => {
      if (opener && opener.isConnected && typeof opener.focus === 'function') {
        opener.focus();
      }
    };

    const TAB_ORDER_STORAGE_KEY = 'mk-stock-lab:portfolio-tab-order:v1';

    const readTabOrderFromStorage = (): string[] => {
      try {
        const raw = localStorage.getItem(TAB_ORDER_STORAGE_KEY);
        if (!raw) return [];
        const parsed: unknown = JSON.parse(raw);
        if (!Array.isArray(parsed) || !parsed.every((item) => typeof item === 'string')) {
          localStorage.removeItem(TAB_ORDER_STORAGE_KEY);
          return [];
        }
        return parsed as string[];
      } catch {
        return [];
      }
    };

    const saveTabOrderToStorage = (ids: string[]): void => {
      try {
        localStorage.setItem(TAB_ORDER_STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(ids));
      } catch {
        // localStorage unavailable or quota exceeded; in-memory order is preserved
      }
    };

    const getElement = <T extends HTMLElement>(id: string) => document.getElementById(id) as T | null;
    const selectedPortfolio = () => state.portfolios.find((portfolio) => portfolio.id === state.selectedPortfolioId) ?? null;
    const isAggregatePortfolioId = (id: string | null | undefined) => id === aggregatePortfolioId;
    const isAggregateSelected = () => isAggregatePortfolioId(state.selectedPortfolioId);
    const escapeHtml = (value: string | null | undefined) =>
      String(value || '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, (char) => ({
        '&': '&amp;',
        '<': '&lt;',
        '>': '&gt;',
        '"': '&quot;',
        "'": '&#39;',
      })[char] || char);
    const normalizeLogoKey = (value: string | null | undefined) => String(value || '').trim().toUpperCase();
    const inferCountry = (position: DisplayPortfolioPosition) => {
      const val = getPositionValuation(position);
      if (val?.market === 'KR' || val?.market === 'US') return val.market;
      const mapped = getLogoMapping(position);
      if (mapped?.country === 'KR' || mapped?.country === 'US') return mapped.country;
      if (position.market === 'KR' || position.market === 'US') return position.market;
      return position.currency === 'KRW' ? 'KR' : 'US';
    };
    const getLogoMapping = (position: PortfolioPosition) => {
      const keys = [
        normalizeLogoKey(position.symbol),
        normalizeLogoKey(position.name),
      ].filter(Boolean);
      return keys.map((key) => logoMappings[key]).find(Boolean) ?? null;
    };
    const getSafeLogoUrl = (position: PortfolioPosition) => {
      const logoUrl = getLogoMapping(position)?.logoUrl;
      if (!logoUrl) return null;
      try {
        const url = new URL(logoUrl);
        return url.protocol === 'https:' ? url.toString() : null;
      } catch {
        return null;
      }
    };
    const getAvatarText = (position: DisplayPortfolioPosition) => {
      const label = getPositionPrimaryLabel(position).replace(/\s+/g, '');
      if (!label) return 'MK';
      if (/^[A-Za-z0-9.-]+$/.test(label)) return label.slice(0, 3).toUpperCase();
      return label.slice(0, 2);
    };
    // Phase 4F-HF2 (F-HIGH-03): canonical identity comes from the valuation row
    // (server-resolved against the Universal Master), never from free-text heuristics.
    const getPositionPrimaryLabel = (position: DisplayPortfolioPosition) => {
      const val = getPositionValuation(position);
      if (val?.displayName) return val.displayName;
      return position.name || position.symbol || '종목명 미입력';
    };
    const getPositionSecondaryLabel = (position: DisplayPortfolioPosition) => {
      const val = getPositionValuation(position);
      if (val?.symbol) return val.symbol;
      if (position.symbol && position.symbol !== position.name) return position.symbol;
      return '티커 미확인';
    };
    const formatLocalAmount = (currency: 'KRW' | 'USD', amount: number) =>
      currency === 'USD' ? usdMoney.format(amount) : `${krwMoney.format(amount)}원`;
    const getChartAiHref = (position: PortfolioPosition) => {
      const params = new URLSearchParams();
      if (position.symbol) params.set('symbol', position.symbol);
      const label = getPositionPrimaryLabel(position);
      if (label) params.set('name', label);
      if (position.market) params.set('market', position.market);
      return `/chart-ai?${params.toString()}`;
    };
    const formatBuyPrice = (position: PortfolioPosition) => {
      const local = formatLocalAmount(position.currency, position.buyPrice);
      if (state.currencyDisplayMode === 'krw' && position.currency === 'USD') {
        return { primary: '원화 환산 예정', secondary: local };
      }
      return { primary: local, secondary: '' };
    };
    const getValuationPlaceholder = (portfolio: Portfolio | null, position: PortfolioPosition) => {
      if (state.currencyDisplayMode === 'krw' && position.currency === 'USD') {
        return { primary: '원화 환산 예정', secondary: 'FX 연동 후 원화 표시' };
      }
      if (portfolio?.baseCurrency === 'KRW' && position.currency === 'USD') {
        return { primary: '원화 환산 예정', secondary: '' };
      }
      return { primary: '데이터 대기', secondary: '' };
    };
    const getPositionValuation = (position: DisplayPortfolioPosition): PortfolioValuationRow | null => {
      return (position.id && state.positionValuations[position.id]) || null;
    };
    const getStaleStateLabel = (staleState?: string | null): string => {
      switch (staleState) {
        case 'fresh': return '조회 시점 기준';
        case 'stale-but-usable': return '최근 조회 기준';
        case 'unavailable': return '데이터 일시 불가';
        default: return '연동 실패';
      }
    };
    const getUnsupportedReasonLabel = (reason: string | null | undefined): string => {
      switch (reason) {
        case 'unsupported_market':
        case 'unsupported_currency':
        case 'market_currency_mismatch':
          return '해외 종목 실시간 평가는 다음 단계에서 지원됩니다.';
        case 'missing_symbol':
        case 'invalid_position_data':
          return '평가할 수 없는 종목 정보입니다.';
        case 'quote_unavailable':
          return '현재 시세를 불러오지 못했습니다.';
        default:
          return '평가 불가';
      }
    };
    // Phase 4F (F-MED-01): a 20s freshness window (within the 15-30s range this fix targets) so
    // returning to an already-displayed portfolio within a few seconds reuses the last real quote
    // instead of firing a duplicate valuation request. Explicit refresh and any mutation that
    // actually changed positions always pass `force: true` and bypass this entirely.
    const VALUATION_FRESHNESS_TTL_MS = 20_000;
    let valuationCache: Record<string, { result: PortfolioValuationResult; fetchedAt: number }> = {};
    const valuationInFlight: Record<string, Promise<void>> = {};
    let valuationRequestSeq = 0;

    const applyValuationResult = (result: PortfolioValuationResult) => {
      const newValuations: Record<string, PortfolioValuationRow> = {};
      for (const row of result.rows) {
        newValuations[row.positionId] = row;
      }
      state.positionValuations = newValuations;
      state.valuationTotals = result.totals;
      state.valuationGeneratedAt = result.generatedAt;
      state.valuationStaleState = result.staleState;
      state.valuationState = result.state;
      state.valuationMessage =
        result.state === 'partial'
          ? '지원 종목 기준 · 일부 종목은 평가할 수 없습니다.'
          : result.state === 'unavailable'
          ? '현재 평가할 수 있는 종목이 없습니다.'
          : null;
    };

    const loadValuation = async (
      portfolioId: string,
      positions: DisplayPortfolioPosition[],
      options: { force?: boolean } = {},
    ) => {
      const force = options.force ?? false;

      if (positions.length === 0) {
        delete valuationCache[portfolioId];
        state.positionValuations = {};
        state.valuationState = 'empty';
        state.valuationMessage = null;
        state.valuationTotals = null;
        state.valuationGeneratedAt = null;
        state.valuationStaleState = null;
        state.valuationRefreshing = false;
        renderPositions();
        return;
      }

      const cached = valuationCache[portfolioId];
      const decision = decideValuationFetch({
        force,
        hasCachedResult: !!cached,
        cacheAgeMs: cached ? Date.now() - cached.fetchedAt : null,
        ttlMs: VALUATION_FRESHNESS_TTL_MS,
        inFlight: !!valuationInFlight[portfolioId],
      });

      if (decision === 'use-cache' && cached) {
        applyValuationResult(cached.result);
        state.valuationRefreshing = false;
        renderPositions();
        return;
      }

      if (decision === 'join-inflight' && valuationInFlight[portfolioId]) {
        await valuationInFlight[portfolioId];
        const settled = valuationCache[portfolioId];
        if (settled) applyValuationResult(settled.result);
        renderPositions();
        return;
      }

      const requestSeq = ++valuationRequestSeq;
      const isBackgroundRefresh = decision === 'fetch-background' && !!cached;
      if (isBackgroundRefresh && cached) {
        applyValuationResult(cached.result);
        state.valuationRefreshing = true;
      } else {
        state.valuationState = 'loading';
        state.valuationMessage = null;
        state.valuationRefreshing = false;
      }
      renderPositions();

      const run = (async () => {
        try {
          const result = await portfolioApi.getValuation(portfolioId);
          if (requestSeq !== valuationRequestSeq) return;
          valuationCache[portfolioId] = { result, fetchedAt: Date.now() };
          applyValuationResult(result);
        } catch (error) {
          if (requestSeq !== valuationRequestSeq) return;
          if (!isBackgroundRefresh) {
            state.valuationState = 'error';
            state.valuationMessage = '평가값을 불러오지 못했습니다.';
          }
          // Background refresh failure: keep the prior usable numbers on screen rather than
          // clobbering them with an error -- the user already has a usable, if slightly stale, view.
        } finally {
          if (requestSeq === valuationRequestSeq) state.valuationRefreshing = false;
          renderPositions();
        }
      })();

      valuationInFlight[portfolioId] = run.finally(() => {
        delete valuationInFlight[portfolioId];
      });
      await valuationInFlight[portfolioId];
    };
    type PositionSortKind = 'weight' | 'valuation' | 'return' | 'profit';
    const getPositionSortValue = (position: DisplayPortfolioPosition, kind: PositionSortKind): number | null => {
      if (kind === 'weight') {
        const costBasis = position.buyPrice * position.quantity;
        return Number.isFinite(costBasis) && costBasis > 0 ? costBasis : null;
      }
      const posVal = getPositionValuation(position);
      if (kind === 'valuation') return posVal?.marketValue ?? null;
      if (kind === 'return') return posVal?.unrealizedPnlPct ?? null;
      if (kind === 'profit') return posVal?.unrealizedPnl ?? null;
      return null;
    };
    const getOrderedPortfolios = () => {
      const byId = new Map(state.portfolios.map((portfolio) => [portfolio.id, portfolio]));
      const ordered = state.portfolioOrder.map((id) => byId.get(id)).filter(Boolean) as Portfolio[];
      const missing = state.portfolios.filter((portfolio) => !state.portfolioOrder.includes(portfolio.id));
      return [...ordered, ...missing];
    };
    const getAggregatePositionKey = (position: PortfolioPosition) => {
      const market = normalizeLogoKey(position.market || 'NA');
      const symbol = normalizeLogoKey(position.symbol || position.name || position.id);
      return `${market}::${symbol}`;
    };
    const toSafeAggregateId = (key: string) => `aggregate-${key.replace(/[^A-Za-z0-9_-]/g, '-')}`;
    const getAggregatePositions = () => {
      type AggregateDraft = DisplayPortfolioPosition & {
        totalCostBasis: number;
        totalQuantity: number;
      };
      const grouped = new Map<string, AggregateDraft>();
      const portfolioById = new Map(state.portfolios.map((portfolio) => [portfolio.id, portfolio]));

      getOrderedPortfolios().forEach((portfolio) => {
        (state.positionsByPortfolioId[portfolio.id] || []).forEach((position) => {
          const key = getAggregatePositionKey(position);
          const quantity = Number.isFinite(position.quantity) ? position.quantity : 0;
          const buyPrice = Number.isFinite(position.buyPrice) ? position.buyPrice : 0;
          const totalCostBasis = buyPrice * quantity;
          const sourceName = portfolioById.get(portfolio.id)?.name || portfolio.name;
          const existing = grouped.get(key);

          if (!existing) {
            grouped.set(key, {
              ...position,
              id: toSafeAggregateId(key),
              portfolioId: aggregatePortfolioId,
              quantity,
              buyPrice,
              memo: '',
              sourcePortfolioIds: [portfolio.id],
              sourcePortfolioNames: [sourceName],
              sourcePositionIds: [position.id],
              totalCostBasis,
              totalQuantity: quantity,
            });
            return;
          }

          existing.quantity += quantity;
          existing.totalCostBasis += totalCostBasis;
          existing.totalQuantity += quantity;
          existing.buyPrice = existing.totalQuantity > 0 ? existing.totalCostBasis / existing.totalQuantity : existing.buyPrice;
          if (!existing.name && position.name) existing.name = position.name;
          if (!existing.symbol && position.symbol) existing.symbol = position.symbol;
          if (!existing.market && position.market) existing.market = position.market;
          if (!existing.buyDate && position.buyDate) existing.buyDate = position.buyDate;
          if (!existing.sourcePortfolioIds?.includes(portfolio.id)) existing.sourcePortfolioIds?.push(portfolio.id);
          if (!existing.sourcePortfolioNames?.includes(sourceName)) existing.sourcePortfolioNames?.push(sourceName);
          if (!existing.sourcePositionIds?.includes(position.id)) existing.sourcePositionIds?.push(position.id);
        });
      });

      return Array.from(grouped.values()).sort((a, b) => getPositionPrimaryLabel(a).localeCompare(getPositionPrimaryLabel(b), 'ko-KR'));
    };
    const getPositionSourceText = (position: DisplayPortfolioPosition) => {
      if (!isAggregateSelected()) return '';
      const names = position.sourcePortfolioNames || [];
      if (names.length === 0) return '';
      return `포함: ${names.join(', ')}`;
    };
    const getSortedPositions = () => {
      const rows = [...state.positions];
      if (state.positionSort === 'none') return rows;

      const lastDash = state.positionSort.lastIndexOf('-');
      const kind = state.positionSort.slice(0, lastDash) as PositionSortKind;
      const direction = state.positionSort.slice(lastDash + 1) as 'asc' | 'desc';
      return rows
        .map((position, index) => ({ position, index, value: getPositionSortValue(position, kind) }))
        .sort((a, b) => {
          if (a.value === null && b.value === null) return a.index - b.index;
          if (a.value === null) return 1;
          if (b.value === null) return -1;
          return direction === 'asc' ? a.value - b.value : b.value - a.value;
        })
        .map((item) => item.position);
    };

    const showToast = (message: string) => {
      const toast = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-toast');
      if (!toast) return;
      toast.textContent = message;
      toast.classList.remove('hidden');
      window.setTimeout(() => toast.classList.add('hidden'), 3200);
    };

    const normalizeError = (error: unknown) => {
      if (error instanceof PortfolioApiError) return error.message;
      return '포트폴리오 요청에 실패했습니다.';
    };

    const mapProfileStatus = (status: string): PortfolioState => {
      if (status === 'ready') return 'profile_ready';
      if (status === 'server_config_missing') return 'profile_config_missing';
      if (status === 'public_config_missing') return 'public_config_missing';
      if (status === 'signed_out') return 'signed_out';
      if (status === 'pending') return 'profile_pending';
      return 'profile_failed';
    };

    const setPortfolioState = (nextState: PortfolioState) => {
      const content = stateContent[nextState];
      const root = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-readiness');
      const title = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-readiness-title');
      const copy = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-readiness-copy');
      const login = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-login-status');
      const profile = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-profile-status');
      const api = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-api-status');
      const lockState = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-lock-state');
      const app = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-mvp');

      if (root) {
        root.dataset.state = nextState;
        root.classList.toggle('hidden', content.showLogin);
      }
      if (title) title.textContent = content.title;
      if (copy) copy.textContent = content.copy;
      if (login) login.textContent = content.login;
      if (profile) profile.textContent = content.profile;
      if (api) api.textContent = content.api;
      lockState?.classList.toggle('hidden', !content.showLogin);
      app?.classList.toggle('hidden', !content.showApp);
    };

    const clearPortfolioData = () => {
      state.portfolios = [];
      state.positions = [];
      state.positionsByPortfolioId = {};
      state.selectedPortfolioId = null;
      state.portfolioOrder = [];
      state.loading = false;
      state.positionValuations = {};
      state.valuationState = 'idle';
      state.valuationMessage = null;
      state.valuationTotals = null;
      state.valuationGeneratedAt = null;
      state.valuationStaleState = null;
      state.valuationRefreshing = false;
      valuationCache = {};
      resetPortfolioForm();
      closePositionSheet();
      renderAll();
    };

    const resetPortfolioForm = () => {
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('portfolio-id')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('portfolio-name')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('portfolio-base-currency')!.value = 'KRW';
      getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-submit')!.textContent = '포트폴리오 만들기';
      getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-cancel-edit')?.classList.add('hidden');
    };

    const resetPositionForm = () => {
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-id')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-security-input')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-symbol')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-market')!.value = 'KR';
      getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('position-asset-type')!.value = 'stock';
      getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('position-currency')!.value = 'KRW';
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-buy-date')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-buy-price')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-quantity')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLTextAreaElement>('position-memo')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('position-submit')!.textContent = '종목 추가';
      getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('position-cancel-edit')?.classList.add('hidden');
      selectedPositionInstrument = null;
      closePositionSearchDropdown();
    };

    const openPositionSheet = (mode: 'create' | 'edit' = 'create') => {
      const sheet = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('position-sheet');
      const title = getElement<HTMLElement>('position-sheet-title');
      const submit = getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('position-submit');
      if (!sheet || !title || !submit) return;
      if (positionSheetCloseTimer) {
        window.clearTimeout(positionSheetCloseTimer);
        positionSheetCloseTimer = null;
      }
      positionSheetOpener = document.activeElement instanceof HTMLElement ? document.activeElement : null;
      title.textContent = mode === 'edit' ? '종목 수정' : '종목 추가';
      submit.textContent = mode === 'edit' ? '종목 수정' : '종목 추가';
      sheet.classList.remove('closing');
      sheet.classList.add('open');
      sheet.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
      window.setTimeout(() => getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-security-input')?.focus(), 0);
    };

    const closePositionSheet = () => {
      const sheet = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('position-sheet');
      if (!sheet) {
        resetPositionForm();
        return;
      }

      const finishClose = () => {
        sheet.classList.remove('closing');
        resetPositionForm();
        positionSheetCloseTimer = null;
        restoreOpenerFocus(positionSheetOpener);
        positionSheetOpener = null;
      };

      sheet.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
      if (!sheet.classList.contains('open')) {
        finishClose();
        return;
      }

      sheet.classList.add('closing');
      sheet.classList.remove('open');

      if (window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
        finishClose();
        return;
      }

      if (positionSheetCloseTimer) window.clearTimeout(positionSheetCloseTimer);
      positionSheetCloseTimer = window.setTimeout(finishClose, positionSheetMotionMs);
    };

    const openPortfolioSheet = () => {
      const sheet = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-sheet');
      const toggle = getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-manage-toggle');
      const title = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-sheet-title');
      if (!sheet) return;
      portfolioSheetOpener = document.activeElement instanceof HTMLElement ? document.activeElement : null;
      const isEdit = !!getElement<HTMLInputElement>('portfolio-id')?.value;
      if (title) title.textContent = isEdit ? '포트폴리오 수정' : '포트폴리오 만들기';
      sheet.classList.add('open');
      sheet.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
      if (toggle) toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
      window.setTimeout(() => getElement<HTMLInputElement>('portfolio-name')?.focus(), 0);
    };

    const closePortfolioSheet = () => {
      const sheet = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-sheet');
      const toggle = getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-manage-toggle');
      if (sheet) {
        sheet.classList.remove('open');
        sheet.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
      }
      if (toggle) toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      resetPortfolioForm();
      restoreOpenerFocus(portfolioSheetOpener);
      portfolioSheetOpener = null;
    };

    const getPortfolioTabId = (id: string) => `portfolio-tab-${id}`;

    const renderPortfolios = () => {
      const list = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-list');
      const empty = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-empty');
      if (!list || !empty) return;

      empty.classList.toggle('hidden', state.portfolios.length > 0);

      // Read sheet state before clearing list (add button is re-created inside list)
      const isSheetOpen = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-sheet')?.classList.contains('open') ?? false;
      list.innerHTML = '';

      if (state.portfolios.length === 0) {
        getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-detail-panel')?.removeAttribute('aria-labelledby');
        // Only add tab when no portfolios
        const addBtn = document.createElement('button');
        addBtn.className = 'portfolio-bookmark-tab portfolio-bookmark-tab--add';
        addBtn.id = 'portfolio-manage-toggle';
        addBtn.type = 'button';
        addBtn.dataset.action = 'toggle-manage-panel';
        addBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isSheetOpen ? 'true' : 'false');
        addBtn.setAttribute('aria-controls', 'portfolio-sheet');
        addBtn.textContent = '+ 추가';
        list.appendChild(addBtn);
        return;
      }

      // Aggregate tab — always first, visible label "전체"
      const aggregateTab = document.createElement('button');
      aggregateTab.className = `portfolio-bookmark-tab portfolio-bookmark-tab--aggregate${isAggregateSelected() ? ' portfolio-bookmark-tab--active' : ''}`;
      aggregateTab.type = 'button';
      aggregateTab.dataset.action = 'select';
      aggregateTab.dataset.id = aggregatePortfolioId;
      aggregateTab.id = getPortfolioTabId(aggregatePortfolioId);
      aggregateTab.setAttribute('role', 'tab');
      aggregateTab.setAttribute('aria-selected', isAggregateSelected() ? 'true' : 'false');
      aggregateTab.setAttribute('aria-controls', 'portfolio-detail-panel');
      aggregateTab.tabIndex = isAggregateSelected() ? 0 : -1;
      aggregateTab.textContent = '전체';
      list.appendChild(aggregateTab);

      // User portfolio tabs — reorderable, floating edit/delete above tab row
      getOrderedPortfolios().forEach((portfolio, index, ordered) => {
        const isFirst = index === 0;
        const isLast = index === ordered.length - 1;
        const isActive = portfolio.id === state.selectedPortfolioId;

        const item = document.createElement('span');
        item.className = 'portfolio-tab-item';
        item.dataset.portfolioId = portfolio.id;

        // Floating mini toolbar above the tab — appears on hover/focus-within
        const floatingActions = document.createElement('span');
        floatingActions.className = 'portfolio-tab-floating-actions';

        const editBtn = document.createElement('button');
        editBtn.className = 'portfolio-tab-inline-action';
        editBtn.type = 'button';
        editBtn.dataset.action = 'edit-portfolio';
        editBtn.dataset.id = portfolio.id;
        editBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', `${portfolio.name} 수정`);
        editBtn.textContent = '수정';

        const deleteBtn = document.createElement('button');
        deleteBtn.className = 'portfolio-tab-inline-action danger';
        deleteBtn.type = 'button';
        deleteBtn.dataset.action = 'delete-portfolio';
        deleteBtn.dataset.id = portfolio.id;
        deleteBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', `${portfolio.name} 삭제`);
        deleteBtn.textContent = '삭제';

        floatingActions.appendChild(editBtn);
        floatingActions.appendChild(deleteBtn);

        // Main tab row: reorder arrows + tab button
        const tabMain = document.createElement('span');
        tabMain.className = 'portfolio-tab-main';

        const leftBtn = document.createElement('button');
        leftBtn.className = 'portfolio-tab-reorder-btn portfolio-tab-reorder-btn--left';
        leftBtn.type = 'button';
        leftBtn.dataset.action = 'move-portfolio-up';
        leftBtn.dataset.id = portfolio.id;
        leftBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', `${portfolio.name} 왼쪽으로 이동`);
        leftBtn.textContent = '‹';
        leftBtn.disabled = isFirst;

        const tabBtn = document.createElement('button');
        tabBtn.className = `portfolio-bookmark-tab portfolio-bookmark-tab--portfolio${isActive ? ' portfolio-bookmark-tab--active' : ''}`;
        tabBtn.type = 'button';
        tabBtn.dataset.action = 'select';
        tabBtn.dataset.id = portfolio.id;
        tabBtn.id = getPortfolioTabId(portfolio.id);
        tabBtn.setAttribute('role', 'tab');
        tabBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', isActive ? 'true' : 'false');
        tabBtn.setAttribute('aria-controls', 'portfolio-detail-panel');
        tabBtn.tabIndex = isActive ? 0 : -1;
        tabBtn.textContent = portfolio.name;

        const rightBtn = document.createElement('button');
        rightBtn.className = 'portfolio-tab-reorder-btn portfolio-tab-reorder-btn--right';
        rightBtn.type = 'button';
        rightBtn.dataset.action = 'move-portfolio-down';
        rightBtn.dataset.id = portfolio.id;
        rightBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', `${portfolio.name} 오른쪽으로 이동`);
        rightBtn.textContent = '›';
        rightBtn.disabled = isLast;

        tabMain.appendChild(leftBtn);
        tabMain.appendChild(tabBtn);
        tabMain.appendChild(rightBtn);

        item.appendChild(floatingActions);
        item.appendChild(tabMain);
        list.appendChild(item);
      });

      // Inline add tab — same-level, immediately after user portfolio tabs
      const addBtn = document.createElement('button');
      addBtn.className = 'portfolio-bookmark-tab portfolio-bookmark-tab--add';
      addBtn.id = 'portfolio-manage-toggle';
      addBtn.type = 'button';
      addBtn.dataset.action = 'toggle-manage-panel';
      addBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isSheetOpen ? 'true' : 'false');
      addBtn.setAttribute('aria-controls', 'portfolio-sheet');
      addBtn.textContent = '+ 추가';
      list.appendChild(addBtn);

      const selectedTabId = isAggregateSelected()
        ? getPortfolioTabId(aggregatePortfolioId)
        : state.selectedPortfolioId
          ? getPortfolioTabId(state.selectedPortfolioId)
          : null;
      const panel = getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-detail-panel');
      if (panel) {
        if (selectedTabId) {
          panel.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', selectedTabId);
        } else {
          panel.removeAttribute('aria-labelledby');
        }
      }
    };

    const renderPositions = () => {
      const portfolio = selectedPortfolio();
      const aggregateSelected = isAggregateSelected();
      const title = getElement<HTMLElement>('selected-portfolio-title');
      const meta = getElement<HTMLElement>('selected-portfolio-meta');
      const openSheetButton = getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('open-position-sheet');
      const empty = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('positions-empty');
      const wrap = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('positions-list-wrap');
      const list = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('positions-list');
      if (!title || !meta || !openSheetButton || !empty || !wrap || !list) return;

      list.innerHTML = '';

      const kpiEl = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-kpi-summary');

      if (!portfolio && !aggregateSelected) {
        title.textContent = '포트폴리오를 선택하세요';
        meta.textContent = '포트폴리오를 선택하면 보유 종목 관리 영역이 표시됩니다.';
        openSheetButton.classList.add('hidden');
        empty.textContent = '포트폴리오를 선택하면 보유 종목을 관리할 수 있습니다.';
        empty.classList.remove('hidden');
        wrap.classList.add('hidden');
        if (kpiEl) kpiEl.classList.add('hidden');
        closePositionSheet();
        return;
      }

      title.textContent = aggregateSelected ? '' : portfolio!.name;
      meta.textContent = '';
      openSheetButton.classList.toggle('hidden', aggregateSelected);
      if (aggregateSelected) closePositionSheet();

      empty.textContent = state.portfolios.length === 0 ? '아직 등록된 포트폴리오가 없습니다.' : '아직 등록된 보유 종목이 없습니다.';
      empty.classList.toggle('hidden', state.positions.length > 0);
      wrap.classList.toggle('hidden', state.positions.length === 0);

      const statusCopyEl = getElement<HTMLParagraphElement>('valuation-status-copy');
      if (statusCopyEl) {
        if (state.valuationState === 'loading') {
          statusCopyEl.hidden = false;
          statusCopyEl.textContent = '실시간 시세로 평가하는 중입니다.';
        } else if (state.valuationRefreshing) {
          statusCopyEl.hidden = false;
          statusCopyEl.textContent = '시세를 새로고침하는 중입니다.';
        } else if (state.valuationMessage) {
          statusCopyEl.hidden = false;
          statusCopyEl.textContent = state.valuationMessage;
        } else if (state.valuationState === 'full' && state.valuationStaleState === 'stale-but-usable') {
          statusCopyEl.hidden = false;
          statusCopyEl.textContent = '최근 조회된 시세를 기준으로 표시합니다.';
        } else {
          statusCopyEl.hidden = true;
          statusCopyEl.textContent = '';
        }
      }

      const refreshButton = getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-refresh');
      if (refreshButton) refreshButton.disabled = state.valuationState === 'loading' || state.valuationRefreshing;

      const sortedPositions = getSortedPositions();
      const totalCostBasis = sortedPositions.reduce((sum, p) => {
        const cb = p.buyPrice * p.quantity;
        return sum + (Number.isFinite(cb) ? cb : 0);
      }, 0);

      sortedPositions.forEach((position) => {
        const item = document.createElement('article');
        const logoUrl = getSafeLogoUrl(position);
        const country = inferCountry(position);
        const primaryLabel = getPositionPrimaryLabel(position);
        const secondaryLabel = getPositionSecondaryLabel(position);
        const sourceText = getPositionSourceText(position);
        const buyPrice = formatBuyPrice(position);
        const posVal = getPositionValuation(position);
        const cb = position.buyPrice * position.quantity;
        const weightPct = (totalCostBasis > 0 && Number.isFinite(cb) && cb > 0)
          ? `${(cb / totalCostBasis * 100).toFixed(1)}%`
          : '데이터 대기';
        const currentPriceDisplay = posVal?.currentPrice != null
          ? formatLocalAmount(position.currency, posVal.currentPrice)
          : null;
        const marketValueDisplay = posVal?.marketValue != null
          ? formatLocalAmount(position.currency, posVal.marketValue)
          : null;
        const pnlPctDisplay = posVal?.unrealizedPnlPct != null
          ? `${posVal.unrealizedPnlPct > 0 ? '+' : ''}${posVal.unrealizedPnlPct.toFixed(2)}%`
          : null;
        const pnlDisplay = posVal?.unrealizedPnl != null
          ? `${posVal.unrealizedPnl > 0 ? '+' : ''}${formatLocalAmount(position.currency, posVal.unrealizedPnl)}`
          : null;
        const isUnsupported = posVal?.supported === false;
        const isUnavailable = posVal != null && !isUnsupported && (posVal.currentPrice == null || posVal.marketValue == null);
        const unavailableLabel = posVal ? getUnsupportedReasonLabel(posVal.unsupportedReason) : '';
        const currentPriceFinal = (isUnsupported || isUnavailable) ? '—' : (currentPriceDisplay ?? '평가 대기');
        const marketValueFinal = (isUnsupported || isUnavailable) ? '—' : (marketValueDisplay ?? '평가 대기');
        const pnlPctFinal = (isUnsupported || isUnavailable) ? '—' : (pnlPctDisplay ?? '평가 대기');
        const pnlFinal = (isUnsupported || isUnavailable) ? '—' : (pnlDisplay ?? '평가 대기');
        const staleBadgeHtml = isUnsupported
          ? `<span class="valuation-stale-badge valuation-stale-badge--unavailable">${escapeHtml(unavailableLabel)}</span>`
          : isUnavailable
          ? `<span class="valuation-stale-badge valuation-stale-badge--unavailable">${escapeHtml(unavailableLabel)}</span>`
          : posVal?.staleState
          ? `<span class="valuation-stale-badge valuation-stale-badge--${escapeHtml(posVal.staleState)}">${escapeHtml(getStaleStateLabel(posVal.staleState))}</span>`
          : '';
        item.className = `position-card${aggregateSelected ? ' aggregate-position' : ''}`;
        item.innerHTML = `
          <div class="security-avatar-wrap">
            <div class="security-avatar">
              ${logoUrl ? `<img src="${escapeHtml(logoUrl)}" alt="" loading="lazy" data-logo-image />` : ''}
              <span class="${logoUrl ? 'hidden' : ''}" data-logo-fallback>${escapeHtml(getAvatarText(position))}</span>
            </div>
            <span class="country-badge">${country}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="position-identity">
            <a class="position-name-link" href="${escapeHtml(getChartAiHref(position))}">
            <strong>${escapeHtml(primaryLabel)}</strong>
            <small>${escapeHtml(secondaryLabel)}</small>
            </a>
            ${sourceText ? `<small class="position-source-text">${escapeHtml(sourceText)}</small>` : ''}
          </div>
          <div class="position-metric">
            <strong class="${weightPct === '데이터 대기' ? 'metric-placeholder' : ''}">${escapeHtml(weightPct)}</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="position-metric">
            <strong>${money.format(position.quantity)}</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="position-metric position-metric--group">
            <strong>${escapeHtml(formatLocalAmount(position.currency, position.buyPrice))}</strong>
            <small class="${currentPriceDisplay == null ? 'metric-placeholder' : ''}">${escapeHtml(currentPriceFinal)}</small>
            ${staleBadgeHtml}
          </div>
          <div class="position-metric position-metric--group">
            <strong class="${marketValueDisplay == null ? 'metric-placeholder' : ''}">${escapeHtml(marketValueFinal)}</strong>
            <small>${escapeHtml(formatLocalAmount(position.currency, position.buyPrice * position.quantity))}</small>
          </div>
          <div class="position-metric position-metric--group">
            <strong class="${pnlPctDisplay == null ? 'metric-placeholder' : ''}">${escapeHtml(pnlPctFinal)}</strong>
            <small class="${pnlDisplay == null ? 'metric-placeholder' : ''}">${escapeHtml(pnlFinal)}</small>
          </div>
          <div class="position-metric position-metric--group">
            <strong class="metric-placeholder">데이터 대기</strong>
            <small class="metric-placeholder">데이터 대기</small>
          </div>
          <div class="table-actions position-actions">
            ${aggregateSelected
              ? '<span class="readonly-badge">읽기 전용</span>'
              : `<button class="table-action-button" type="button" data-action="edit-position" data-id="${position.id}">수정</button>
            <button class="table-action-button danger" type="button" data-action="delete-position" data-id="${position.id}">삭제</button>`}
          </div>
        `;
        list.appendChild(item);
      });

      // KPI summary block (supported KR/KRW positions only; see valuationTotals contract)
      if (kpiEl) {
        if (sortedPositions.length === 0) {
          kpiEl.classList.add('hidden');
        } else {
          const totals = state.valuationTotals;
          const isPartial = state.valuationState === 'partial';
          const isUnavailableState = state.valuationState === 'unavailable';
          const totalMarketValue = totals?.supportedMarketValue ?? null;
          const kpiValueEl = kpiEl.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.kpi-value');
          const kpiProfitEl = kpiEl.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.kpi-profit');
          const kpiLabelEl = kpiEl.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.kpi-label');
          if (kpiLabelEl) {
            kpiLabelEl.textContent = isPartial ? '지원 종목 기준 총 자산' : isUnavailableState ? '평가 불가' : '총 자산';
          }
          if (kpiValueEl) {
            kpiValueEl.textContent = totalMarketValue == null
              ? '—'
              : formatLocalAmount('KRW', totalMarketValue);
          }
          if (kpiProfitEl) {
            if (totalMarketValue == null || totals == null) {
              kpiProfitEl.textContent = isUnavailableState
                ? '평가 가능한 국내 종목이 없습니다.'
                : '—';
              kpiProfitEl.className = 'kpi-profit neutral';
            } else {
              const totalPnl = totals.supportedUnrealizedPnl ?? 0;
              const totalPnlPct = totals.supportedUnrealizedPnlPct ?? 0;
              const sign = totalPnl >= 0 ? '+' : '';
              const coverageNote = isPartial
                ? ` · 제외 ${totals.unsupportedPositionCount + totals.unavailableQuoteCount}개`
                : '';
              kpiProfitEl.textContent = `${sign}${formatLocalAmount('KRW', totalPnl)}(${sign}${totalPnlPct.toFixed(2)}%) 총 수익${coverageNote}`;
              kpiProfitEl.className = `kpi-profit ${totalPnl > 0 ? 'positive' : totalPnl < 0 ? 'negative' : 'neutral'}`;
            }
          }
          kpiEl.classList.remove('hidden');
        }
      }
    };

    const renderAll = () => {
      renderPortfolios();
      renderPositions();
    };

    // Phase 4F (F-MED-01): dedup concurrent positions fetches for the SAME portfolio id -- a
    // single-portfolio tab click and an aggregate "all portfolios" load racing for the same
    // portfolio's positions now share one network request instead of firing two.
    const positionsInFlight: Record<string, Promise<DisplayPortfolioPosition[]>> = {};
    const fetchPositionsDeduped = (portfolioId: string) => {
      if (positionsInFlight[portfolioId]) return positionsInFlight[portfolioId];
      const request = portfolioApi.listPositions(portfolioId).finally(() => {
        delete positionsInFlight[portfolioId];
      });
      positionsInFlight[portfolioId] = request;
      return request;
    };

    const loadAllPortfolioPositions = async (force = false) => {
      await Promise.all(getOrderedPortfolios().map(async (portfolio) => {
        const decision = decidePositionsFetch({
          force,
          hasCachedEntry: !!state.positionsByPortfolioId[portfolio.id],
        });
        if (decision === 'use-cache') return;
        state.positionsByPortfolioId[portfolio.id] = await fetchPositionsDeduped(portfolio.id);
      }));
    };

    const loadPositions = async (portfolioId: string, force = false) => {
      if (isAggregatePortfolioId(portfolioId)) {
        await loadAllPortfolioPositions(force);
        state.positions = getAggregatePositions();
        renderPositions();
        await loadValuation(portfolioId, state.positions, { force });
        return;
      }

      const decision = decidePositionsFetch({
        force,
        hasCachedEntry: !!state.positionsByPortfolioId[portfolioId],
      });
      if (decision === 'use-cache') {
        state.positions = state.positionsByPortfolioId[portfolioId];
        renderPositions();
        await loadValuation(portfolioId, state.positions, { force: false });
        return;
      }

      const positions = await fetchPositionsDeduped(portfolioId);
      state.positionsByPortfolioId[portfolioId] = positions;
      state.positions = positions;
      renderPositions();
      await loadValuation(portfolioId, state.positions, { force });
    };

    // Phase 3GI: best-effort cross-device resume-state persistence. Only ever persists a real,
    // owned portfolio id -- never the aggregate `__all_portfolios__` sentinel -- and is
    // deduplicated so re-selecting the same portfolio does not re-write on every render.
    let lastPersistedPortfolioId: string | null = null;

    const persistPortfolioResumeState = (id: string) => {
      if (isAggregatePortfolioId(id) || id === lastPersistedPortfolioId) return;
      void (async () => {
        const hasSession = await hasRetentionSession();
        if (!hasSession) return;
        lastPersistedPortfolioId = id;
        try {
          await userRetentionApi.updatePreferences({
            lastSurface: 'portfolio',
            lastPortfolioId: id,
          });
        } catch {
          // Best-effort only -- resume state failing to save must never affect the portfolio UI.
        }
      })();
    };

    const consumeRequestedPortfolioIdFromUrl = (): string | null => {
      try {
        const requested = new URL(window.location.href).searchParams.get('portfolio');
        return requested && requested.trim() ? requested.trim() : null;
      } catch {
        return null;
      }
    };

    // Phase 4F (F-MED-01): `forcePositions` defaults to false because a portfolio-metadata
    // mutation (rename/create/delete) never changes any existing portfolio's positions -- only an
    // explicit refresh (§3D) needs to bypass the positions/valuation cache here.
    const loadPortfolios = async ({ forcePositions = false }: { forcePositions?: boolean } = {}) => {
      state.portfolios = await portfolioApi.listPortfolios();
      const knownIds = new Set(state.portfolios.map((portfolio) => portfolio.id));
      state.positionsByPortfolioId = Object.fromEntries(
        Object.entries(state.positionsByPortfolioId).filter(([id]) => knownIds.has(id)),
      );
      const savedOrder = readTabOrderFromStorage();
      const baseOrder = savedOrder.length > 0 ? savedOrder : state.portfolioOrder;
      state.portfolioOrder = [
        ...baseOrder.filter((id) => knownIds.has(id)),
        ...state.portfolios.map((portfolio) => portfolio.id).filter((id) => !baseOrder.includes(id)),
      ];
      saveTabOrderToStorage(state.portfolioOrder);

      // A `?portfolio=<id>` deep link (from the Home resume card) only ever wins when it names a
      // portfolio the signed-in user actually owns -- otherwise it silently falls back to the
      // normal aggregate/last-selection behavior below.
      const requestedId = consumeRequestedPortfolioIdFromUrl();
      if (requestedId && state.portfolios.some((portfolio) => portfolio.id === requestedId)) {
        state.selectedPortfolioId = requestedId;
      } else if (state.portfolios.length === 0) {
        state.selectedPortfolioId = null;
      } else if (
        !state.selectedPortfolioId ||
        (!isAggregateSelected() && !state.portfolios.some((portfolio) => portfolio.id === state.selectedPortfolioId))
      ) {
        state.selectedPortfolioId = aggregatePortfolioId;
      }
      renderAll();
      if (state.selectedPortfolioId) {
        await loadPositions(state.selectedPortfolioId, forcePositions);
        persistPortfolioResumeState(state.selectedPortfolioId);
      }
    };

    const loadPortfolioMvp = async () => {
      if (state.loading) return;
      try {
        state.loading = true;
        setPortfolioState('api_pending');
        await loadPortfolios();
        setPortfolioState('ready');
        portfolioReadyForSession = true;
      } catch (error) {
        setPortfolioState(error instanceof PortfolioApiError && error.status === 503 ? 'portfolio_config_missing' : 'profile_failed');
        showToast(normalizeError(error));
      } finally {
        state.loading = false;
      }
    };

    const runProfileAndPortfolioLoad = async () => {
      setPortfolioState('signed_in');
      const result = await bootstrapProfileForCurrentSession();
      const ready = result.status === 'ready';
      setPortfolioState(ready ? 'profile_ready' : mapProfileStatus(result.status));
      if (ready) await loadPortfolioMvp();
    };

    // Phase 4F (F-MED-01): three independent triggers (this page's own init, Header.astro's
    // direct post-login sync, and Header's `mk:auth-state` broadcast) can each ask for a
    // profile+portfolio bootstrap for the SAME signed-in session. `portfolioReadyForSession`
    // makes a bootstrap that already finished a true no-op; `bootstrapInFlight` makes a bootstrap
    // that is still running something later triggers join instead of duplicating. Only a real
    // sign-out (which resets both) allows a fresh bootstrap to start again.
    let portfolioReadyForSession = false;
    let bootstrapInFlight: Promise<void> | null = null;

    const ensureProfileAndPortfolioReady = (): Promise<void> => {
      const action = decideBootstrapAction({
        readyForSession: portfolioReadyForSession,
        inFlight: !!bootstrapInFlight,
      });
      if (action === 'skip') return Promise.resolve();
      if (action === 'join' && bootstrapInFlight) return bootstrapInFlight;

      bootstrapInFlight = runProfileAndPortfolioLoad().finally(() => {
        bootstrapInFlight = null;
      });
      return bootstrapInFlight;
    };

    const initPortfolioReadiness = async () => {
      const marker = window as Window & { mkPortfolioMvpReady?: boolean };
      if (marker.mkPortfolioMvpReady) return;
      marker.mkPortfolioMvpReady = true;

      getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-login-action')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('mk:open-auth'));
      });

      if (!isSupabaseConfigured()) {
        setPortfolioState('public_config_missing');
        return;
      }

      const supabase = getBrowserSupabaseClient();
      if (!supabase) {
        setPortfolioState('public_config_missing');
        return;
      }

      const { data } = await supabase.auth.getSession();
      if (!data.session) {
        portfolioReadyForSession = false;
        clearPortfolioData();
        setPortfolioState('signed_out');
        return;
      }

      await ensureProfileAndPortfolioReady();
    };

    // Phase 4F (F-MED-01): explicit refresh must force-reload current data WITHOUT going through
    // loadPortfolioMvp's setPortfolioState('api_pending') -- that hid the whole app and re-showed
    // the readiness screen on every refresh click (§4/§10). A simple busy flag stops rapid
    // double-clicks from firing a second overlapping refresh.
    let explicitRefreshInFlight = false;
    getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-refresh')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (explicitRefreshInFlight) return;
      explicitRefreshInFlight = true;
      void loadPortfolios({ forcePositions: true })
        .catch((error) => showToast(normalizeError(error)))
        .finally(() => {
          explicitRefreshInFlight = false;
        });
    });

    getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-cancel-edit')?.addEventListener('click', closePortfolioSheet);
    getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('position-cancel-edit')?.addEventListener('click', closePositionSheet);
    getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('open-position-sheet')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (isAggregateSelected()) {
        showToast('개별 포트폴리오를 선택한 뒤 종목을 추가해 주세요.');
        return;
      }
      resetPositionForm();
      openPositionSheet('create');
    });
    getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('position-sheet-close')?.addEventListener('click', closePositionSheet);
    getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('position-sheet-backdrop')?.addEventListener('click', closePositionSheet);
    getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-sheet-close')?.addEventListener('click', closePortfolioSheet);
    getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-sheet-backdrop')?.addEventListener('click', closePortfolioSheet);
    window.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
      const positionSheetOpen = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('position-sheet')?.classList.contains('open');
      const portfolioSheetOpen = getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-sheet')?.classList.contains('open');

      if (event.key === 'Escape') {
        if (positionSheetOpen) {
          closePositionSheet();
        } else if (portfolioSheetOpen) {
          closePortfolioSheet();
        }
        return;
      }

      if (event.key !== 'Tab') return;
      if (!positionSheetOpen && !portfolioSheetOpen) return;

      const panel = positionSheetOpen
        ? getElement<HTMLElement>('position-sheet')?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.position-sheet-panel') ?? null
        : getElement<HTMLElement>('portfolio-sheet')?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.portfolio-sheet-panel') ?? null;
      const focusable = getDialogFocusableElements(panel);
      if (focusable.length === 0) return;
      const currentIndex = focusable.indexOf(document.activeElement as HTMLElement);
      const wrap = computeDialogFocusWrap(focusable.length, currentIndex, event.shiftKey);
      if (wrap.shouldIntercept) {
        event.preventDefault();
        focusable[wrap.targetIndex]?.focus();
      }
    });

    // Phase 4F-HF2 (F-HIGH-03): accessible instrument combobox reusing the Universal Master
    // search route. A canonical selection is a first-class client state (`selectedPositionInstrument`),
    // never re-derived from visible text; the server remains authoritative (resolveCanonicalOrFail).
    type PositionCanonicalInstrument = {
      symbol: string;
      displayName: string;
      country: 'KR' | 'US';
      exchange: string;
      assetType: 'stock' | 'etf';
      currency: 'KRW' | 'USD';
    };

    let selectedPositionInstrument: PositionCanonicalInstrument | null = null;
    let positionSearchSeq = 0;
    let positionSearchDebounceId: number | null = null;
    let positionSearchAbort: AbortController | null = null;
    let positionSearchResultCache: PositionCanonicalInstrument[] = [];

    const positionAssetTypeLabel = (assetType: string) => (assetType === 'etf' ? 'ETF' : '주식');
    const getPositionSecurityInputEl = () => getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-security-input');
    const getPositionSearchDropdownEl = () => getElement<HTMLDivElement>('position-search-dropdown');
    const getPositionSearchResultsEl = () => getElement<HTMLDivElement>('position-search-results');
    const getPositionSearchEmptyEl = () => getElement<HTMLParagraphElement>('position-search-empty');

    const closePositionSearchDropdown = () => {
      getPositionSearchDropdownEl()?.classList.add('hidden');
      const results = getPositionSearchResultsEl();
      if (results) results.innerHTML = '';
      getPositionSearchEmptyEl()?.classList.add('hidden');
      const input = getPositionSecurityInputEl();
      input?.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      input?.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant');
    };

    const applySelectedInstrumentToForm = (instrument: PositionCanonicalInstrument) => {
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-symbol')!.value = instrument.symbol;
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-market')!.value = instrument.country;
      getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('position-asset-type')!.value = instrument.assetType;
      getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('position-currency')!.value = instrument.currency;
    };

    const clearSelectedInstrument = () => {
      // Phase 4F-HF2-A1: clear the hidden market alongside the hidden symbol so no stale market
      // value can survive into resolvePositionSubmitIdentity's "unmodified hidden row" branch —
      // that branch only trusts hiddenMarket when hiddenSymbol is also non-empty, but clearing both
      // keeps the DOM state itself honest rather than relying solely on the decision function.
      selectedPositionInstrument = null;
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-symbol')!.value = '';
      getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-market')!.value = '';
    };

    const selectPositionInstrument = (instrument: PositionCanonicalInstrument) => {
      selectedPositionInstrument = instrument;
      applySelectedInstrumentToForm(instrument);
      const input = getPositionSecurityInputEl();
      if (input) input.value = `${instrument.displayName} (${instrument.symbol})`;
      closePositionSearchDropdown();
      input?.focus();
    };

    const mapPositionSearchResult = (item: any): PositionCanonicalInstrument | null => {
      if (!item || typeof item.symbol !== 'string' || typeof item.displayName !== 'string') return null;
      const country = item.country === 'KR' || item.country === 'US' ? item.country : null;
      if (!country) return null;
      return {
        symbol: item.symbol,
        displayName: item.displayName,
        country,
        exchange: String(item.exchange || ''),
        assetType: item.assetType === 'etf' ? 'etf' : 'stock',
        currency: item.currency === 'USD' ? 'USD' : 'KRW',
      };
    };

    const renderPositionSearchResults = (instruments: PositionCanonicalInstrument[]) => {
      const results = getPositionSearchResultsEl();
      const empty = getPositionSearchEmptyEl();
      const dropdown = getPositionSearchDropdownEl();
      const input = getPositionSecurityInputEl();
      if (!results || !dropdown || !input) return;

      positionSearchResultCache = instruments;

      if (instruments.length === 0) {
        results.innerHTML = '';
        empty?.classList.remove('hidden');
        dropdown.classList.remove('hidden');
        input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
        return;
      }

      empty?.classList.add('hidden');
      results.innerHTML = instruments
        .map(
          (instrument, index) => `
        <button
          type="button"
          class="position-search-result"
          id="position-search-result-${index}"
          role="option"
          data-index="${index}"
        >
          <span class="position-search-result-name">${escapeHtml(instrument.displayName)}</span>
          <span class="position-search-result-meta">${escapeHtml(instrument.symbol)} · ${instrument.country === 'KR' ? '국내' : '미국'} · ${positionAssetTypeLabel(instrument.assetType)}</span>
        </button>`,
        )
        .join('');
      dropdown.classList.remove('hidden');
      input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
    };

    const runPositionInstrumentSearch = async (query: string) => {
      const trimmed = query.trim();
      if (!trimmed) {
        closePositionSearchDropdown();
        return;
      }
      const seq = ++positionSearchSeq;
      positionSearchAbort?.abort();
      const abort = new AbortController();
      positionSearchAbort = abort;
      try {
        const url = `/api/chart-ai/instruments/search.json?q=${encodeURIComponent(trimmed)}&limit=8`;
        const result = await fetchChartAiJson(url, { signal: abort.signal });
        if (seq !== positionSearchSeq) return;
        if (result.state !== 'SUCCESS' && result.state !== 'NO_RESULTS') {
          closePositionSearchDropdown();
          return;
        }
        const items = Array.isArray(result.data?.items) ? result.data.items : [];
        const mapped = items.map(mapPositionSearchResult).filter((value: unknown): value is PositionCanonicalInstrument => Boolean(value));
        renderPositionSearchResults(mapped);
      } catch (error) {
        if ((error as any)?.name === 'AbortError') return;
        closePositionSearchDropdown();
      }
    };

    const debouncedPositionSearch = (query: string) => {
      if (positionSearchDebounceId !== null) window.clearTimeout(positionSearchDebounceId);
      positionSearchDebounceId = window.setTimeout(() => {
        void runPositionInstrumentSearch(query);
      }, 180);
    };

    getPositionSecurityInputEl()?.addEventListener('input', () => {
      clearSelectedInstrument();
      debouncedPositionSearch(getPositionSecurityInputEl()?.value || '');
    });

    getPositionSecurityInputEl()?.addEventListener('focus', () => {
      const value = getPositionSecurityInputEl()?.value || '';
      if (value.trim() && !selectedPositionInstrument) debouncedPositionSearch(value);
    });

    getPositionSecurityInputEl()?.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
      if (event.key === 'Escape') {
        closePositionSearchDropdown();
        return;
      }
      if (event.key === 'ArrowDown') {
        const first = getPositionSearchResultsEl()?.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.position-search-result');
        if (first) {
          event.preventDefault();
          first.focus();
        }
      }
    });

    getPositionSearchResultsEl()?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      const target = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('.position-search-result');
      if (!target) return;
      const index = Number(target.dataset.index);
      const instrument = positionSearchResultCache[index];
      if (instrument) selectPositionInstrument(instrument);
    });

    getPositionSearchResultsEl()?.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
      const buttons = Array.from(
        getPositionSearchResultsEl()?.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.position-search-result') || [],
      );
      const currentIndex = buttons.indexOf(document.activeElement as HTMLButtonElement);
      if (event.key === 'ArrowDown') {
        event.preventDefault();
        (buttons[currentIndex + 1] ?? buttons[0])?.focus();
      } else if (event.key === 'ArrowUp') {
        event.preventDefault();
        if (currentIndex <= 0) {
          closePositionSearchDropdown();
          getPositionSecurityInputEl()?.focus();
          return;
        }
        buttons[currentIndex - 1]?.focus();
      } else if (event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ' ') {
        event.preventDefault();
        (document.activeElement as HTMLButtonElement)?.click();
      } else if (event.key === 'Escape') {
        closePositionSearchDropdown();
        getPositionSecurityInputEl()?.focus();
      }
    });

    document.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      const wrap = getPositionSecurityInputEl()?.closest('.position-combobox-wrap');
      if (wrap && !wrap.contains(event.target as Node)) closePositionSearchDropdown();
    });

    getElement<HTMLDivElement>('currency-display-toggle')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      const target = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-display-mode]');
      if (!target) return;
      state.currencyDisplayMode = target.dataset.displayMode === 'krw' ? 'krw' : 'local';
      getElement<HTMLDivElement>('currency-display-toggle')
        ?.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-display-mode]')
        .forEach((button) => button.classList.toggle('active', button === target));
      renderPositions();
    });

    getElement<HTMLDivElement>('positions-list-wrap')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      const sortButton = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-sort]');
      if (sortButton) {
        const nextSort = sortButton.dataset.sort as AppState['positionSort'] | undefined;
        if (!nextSort) return;
        state.positionSort = state.positionSort === nextSort ? 'none' : nextSort;
      } else {
        const sortableCell = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLElement>('[data-sort-column]');
        if (!sortableCell) return;
        const col = sortableCell.dataset.sortColumn;
        if (!col) return;
        const descKey = `${col}-desc` as AppState['positionSort'];
        const ascKey = `${col}-asc` as AppState['positionSort'];
        state.positionSort = state.positionSort === descKey ? ascKey : descKey;
      }
      getElement<HTMLDivElement>('positions-list-wrap')
        ?.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-sort]')
        .forEach((button) => button.classList.toggle('active', state.positionSort === button.dataset.sort));
      renderPositions();
    });

    getElement<HTMLDivElement>('positions-list')?.addEventListener('error', (event) => {
      const image = event.target as HTMLImageElement | null;
      if (!image?.matches('[data-logo-image]')) return;
      image.hidden = true;
      image.parentElement?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-logo-fallback]')?.classList.remove('hidden');
    }, true);

    getElement<HTMLFormElement>('portfolio-form')?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const id = getElement<HTMLInputElement>('portfolio-id')!.value;
      const input = {
        name: getElement<HTMLInputElement>('portfolio-name')!.value,
        baseCurrency: getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('portfolio-base-currency')!.value as 'KRW' | 'USD',
      };

      try {
        if (id) {
          await portfolioApi.updatePortfolio({ id, ...input });
          showToast('포트폴리오가 수정되었습니다.');
        } else {
          const created = await portfolioApi.createPortfolio(input);
          state.selectedPortfolioId = created.id;
          showToast('포트폴리오가 생성되었습니다.');
        }
        closePortfolioSheet();
        await loadPortfolios();
      } catch (error) {
        showToast(normalizeError(error));
      }
    });

    const selectPortfolioTab = async (id: string) => {
      state.selectedPortfolioId = id;
      resetPositionForm();
      renderAll();
      await loadPositions(id);
      persistPortfolioResumeState(id);
    };

    getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-list')?.addEventListener('click', async (event) => {
      const target = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-action]');
      if (!target) return;

      if (target.dataset.action === 'toggle-manage-panel') {
        if (getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-sheet')?.classList.contains('open')) {
          closePortfolioSheet();
        } else {
          resetPortfolioForm();
          openPortfolioSheet();
        }
        return;
      }

      const id = target.dataset.id;
      if (!id) return;

      if (target.dataset.action === 'select') {
        await selectPortfolioTab(id);
      }

      if (target.dataset.action === 'move-portfolio-up' || target.dataset.action === 'move-portfolio-down') {
        if (isAggregatePortfolioId(id)) return;
        const ordered = getOrderedPortfolios().map((portfolio) => portfolio.id);
        const index = ordered.indexOf(id);
        const offset = target.dataset.action === 'move-portfolio-up' ? -1 : 1;
        const nextIndex = index + offset;
        if (index < 0 || nextIndex < 0 || nextIndex >= ordered.length) return;
        [ordered[index], ordered[nextIndex]] = [ordered[nextIndex], ordered[index]];
        state.portfolioOrder = ordered;
        saveTabOrderToStorage(state.portfolioOrder);
        renderPortfolios();
      }

      if (target.dataset.action === 'edit-portfolio') {
        if (isAggregatePortfolioId(id)) return;
        const portfolio = state.portfolios.find((item) => item.id === id);
        if (!portfolio) return;
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('portfolio-id')!.value = portfolio.id;
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('portfolio-name')!.value = portfolio.name;
        getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('portfolio-base-currency')!.value = portfolio.baseCurrency;
        getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-submit')!.textContent = '포트폴리오 수정';
        getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('portfolio-cancel-edit')?.classList.remove('hidden');
        openPortfolioSheet();
      }

      if (target.dataset.action === 'delete-portfolio') {
        if (isAggregatePortfolioId(id)) return;
        const portfolio = state.portfolios.find((item) => item.id === id);
        if (!portfolio) return;
        const confirmed = window.confirm(`"${portfolio.name}" 포트폴리오와 보유 종목을 삭제할까요?`);
        if (!confirmed) return;
        try {
          await portfolioApi.deletePortfolio(id);
          if (state.selectedPortfolioId === id) state.selectedPortfolioId = null;
          resetPortfolioForm();
          resetPositionForm();
          showToast('포트폴리오가 삭제되었습니다.');
          await loadPortfolios();
        } catch (error) {
          showToast(normalizeError(error));
        }
      }
    });

    getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-list')?.addEventListener('keydown', async (event) => {
      if (event.key !== 'ArrowLeft' && event.key !== 'ArrowRight' && event.key !== 'Home' && event.key !== 'End') return;
      const target = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('button[role="tab"]');
      if (!target) return;

      const tabs = Array.from(
        getElement<HTMLDivElement>('portfolio-list')?.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button[role="tab"]') ?? [],
      );
      if (tabs.length === 0) return;
      const currentIndex = tabs.indexOf(target);
      const navigation = computeTabRovingNavigation(tabs.length, currentIndex, event.key);
      if (!navigation.handled) return;

      event.preventDefault();
      const nextId = tabs[navigation.nextIndex]?.dataset.id;
      if (!nextId) return;
      await selectPortfolioTab(nextId);
      getElement<HTMLButtonElement>(getPortfolioTabId(nextId))?.focus();
    });

    getElement<HTMLFormElement>('position-form')?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (!state.selectedPortfolioId || isAggregateSelected()) {
        showToast('개별 포트폴리오를 선택한 뒤 종목을 추가해 주세요.');
        return;
      }

      const id = getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-id')!.value;
      const securityInput = getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-security-input')!.value.trim();
      if (!securityInput) {
        showToast('종목명 또는 티커를 입력하세요.');
        return;
      }
      // Phase 4F-HF2 (F-HIGH-03) / HF2-A1: the identity to submit comes from a canonical selection
      // first, then the hidden fields carried over from an unmodified existing row (create/edit
      // re-save), then the raw visible text (exact-match convenience). The hidden market is only
      // trusted alongside a hidden symbol — a raw/modified entry NEVER defaults to KR; the server
      // (resolveCanonicalOrFail) is authoritative and infers the country or rejects anything
      // ambiguous or unresolved. See resolvePositionSubmitIdentity for the decision matrix.
      const identity = resolvePositionSubmitIdentity({
        selected: selectedPositionInstrument
          ? { symbol: selectedPositionInstrument.symbol, country: selectedPositionInstrument.country }
          : null,
        hiddenSymbol: getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-symbol')!.value,
        hiddenMarket: getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-market')!.value,
        securityInput,
      });
      const symbolToSubmit = identity.symbol;
      const market = identity.market;
      const assetType = getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('position-asset-type')!.value as 'stock' | 'etf';
      const currency = getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('position-currency')!.value as 'KRW' | 'USD';
      const input = {
        portfolioId: state.selectedPortfolioId,
        symbol: symbolToSubmit,
        market,
        assetType,
        buyPrice: Number(getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-buy-price')!.value),
        quantity: Number(getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-quantity')!.value),
        buyDate: getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-buy-date')!.value,
        memo: getElement<HTMLTextAreaElement>('position-memo')!.value,
        currency,
      };

      try {
        if (id) {
          await portfolioApi.updatePosition({ id, ...input });
          showToast('종목이 수정되었습니다.');
        } else {
          await portfolioApi.createPosition(input);
          showToast('종목이 추가되었습니다.');
        }
        closePositionSheet();
        // force: true -- this position's data just changed, the positions cache for this
        // portfolio must not be reused (see decidePositionsFetch / F-MED-01).
        await loadPositions(state.selectedPortfolioId, true);
      } catch (error) {
        showToast(normalizeError(error));
      }
    });

    getElement<HTMLDivElement>('positions-list')?.addEventListener('click', async (event) => {
      const target = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-action]');
      if (!target) return;
      const id = target.dataset.id;
      if (!id) return;

      const position = state.positions.find((item) => item.id === id);
      if (!position) return;

      if (target.dataset.action === 'edit-position') {
        // Phase 4F-HF2 (F-HIGH-03): prefill the hidden symbol with the position's CURRENT (possibly
        // legacy/noncanonical) value and clear only the selection state, not the hidden field — so an
        // unmodified re-save still resubmits `position.symbol` and the server re-resolves it canonically.
        selectedPositionInstrument = null;
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-id')!.value = position.id;
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-security-input')!.value = position.name || position.symbol;
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-symbol')!.value = position.symbol;
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-market')!.value = position.market;
        getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('position-asset-type')!.value = position.assetType || 'stock';
        getElement<HTMLSelectElement>('position-currency')!.value = position.currency;
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-buy-date')!.value = position.buyDate || '';
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-buy-price')!.value = String(position.buyPrice);
        getElement<HTMLInputElement>('position-quantity')!.value = String(position.quantity);
        getElement<HTMLTextAreaElement>('position-memo')!.value = position.memo || '';
        getElement<HTMLButtonElement>('position-cancel-edit')?.classList.remove('hidden');
        openPositionSheet('edit');
      }

      if (target.dataset.action === 'delete-position') {
        const confirmed = window.confirm(`"${getPositionPrimaryLabel(position)}" 종목을 삭제할까요?`);
        if (!confirmed || !state.selectedPortfolioId) return;
        try {
          await portfolioApi.deletePosition(id);
          showToast('종목이 삭제되었습니다.');
          // force: true -- see the create/update handler above.
          await loadPositions(state.selectedPortfolioId, true);
        } catch (error) {
          showToast(normalizeError(error));
        }
      }
    });

    // Phase 4F (F-MED-01): Header.astro independently dispatches both of these events for the
    // same login (see module header comment on ensureProfileAndPortfolioReady). Once this page has
    // already reached `ready` for the current session, a duplicate 'ready'/'signed_in' signal must
    // not re-run setPortfolioState('profile_ready'/'signed_in') -- doing so re-hid the already-
    // visible app behind the readiness screen on every ordinary duplicate event (§4).
    window.addEventListener('mk:profile-bootstrap', (event) => {
      const detail = (event as CustomEvent).detail;
      if (!detail?.status) return;
      if (detail.status === 'signed_out') {
        portfolioReadyForSession = false;
        clearPortfolioData();
        setPortfolioState('signed_out');
        return;
      }
      if (portfolioReadyForSession) return;
      setPortfolioState(detail.status === 'ready' ? 'profile_ready' : mapProfileStatus(detail.status));
      if (detail.status === 'ready') void ensureProfileAndPortfolioReady();
    });

    window.addEventListener('mk:auth-state', (event) => {
      const detail = (event as CustomEvent).detail;
      if (detail?.status === 'signed_out') {
        portfolioReadyForSession = false;
        clearPortfolioData();
        setPortfolioState('signed_out');
      }
      if (detail?.status === 'signed_in') {
        if (portfolioReadyForSession) return;
        void ensureProfileAndPortfolioReady();
      }
    });

    document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initPortfolioReadiness);
    initPortfolioReadiness();
  </script>

  <style>
    .valuation-stale-badge {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-top: 0.1rem;
      padding: 0.1em 0.25em;
      border-radius: 2px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      max-width: 8em;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    .valuation-stale-badge--fresh {
      color: var(--positive, #1a7f4b);
    }
    .valuation-stale-badge--stale-but-usable {
      color: var(--neutral, #888);
    }
    .valuation-stale-badge--unavailable {
      color: var(--negative, #c0392b);
    }

    .position-combobox-field {
      position: relative;
    }
    .position-combobox-wrap {
      position: relative;
    }
    .position-search-dropdown {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 20;
      top: calc(100% + 0.25rem);
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: var(--surface, #fff);
      border: 1px solid var(--border, #d8dee9);
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      max-height: 16rem;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 0.25rem;
    }
    .position-search-dropdown.hidden {
      display: none;
    }
    .position-search-results {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.125rem;
    }
    :global(.position-search-result) {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.125rem;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      font: inherit;
      color: inherit;
    }
    :global(.position-search-result:hover),
    :global(.position-search-result:focus) {
      background: var(--surface-hover, #eef2f9);
      outline: none;
    }
    :global(.position-search-result-name) {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    :global(.position-search-result-meta) {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted, #6b7280);
    }
    .position-search-empty {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted, #6b7280);
    }
    .position-search-empty.hidden {
      display: none;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
